# qlogin: the terminal login greeter (fake PAM, private bus: nothing real is touched; the password in this demo is "secret")
Size 80x24
Theme dracula
Title "qlogin"
Cd /tmp
Run sh /data/dev/github/autodemo/.autodemo/examples/qlogin/run
WaitFor "login:" 15s
Caption "qlogin: login on the console, PAM, no GUI" bottom
Sleep 1s
Send "drbongo\n"
WaitFor "password:" 5s
Send "wrong\n"
Caption "a wrong password: the lockout delay grows" bottom
Sleep 2s
Send "drbongo\n"
WaitFor "password:" 5s
Send "secret\n"
Caption "the password is never echoed; then the session picker" bottom
Sleep 3s
SendKey Down
Sleep 1s
Loop
